  "title": "KPN Team",
  "bodyHtml": "<style>\r\n    /* Force the member list into a tighter 2-column layout */\r\n    .member-grid {\r\n        list-style: none !important; /* Removes the bullet points */\r\n        padding: 0 !important;\r\n        margin: 10px 0 25px 0 !important; /* Reduced vertical margins for sections */\r\n        display: grid !important;\r\n        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr) !important; /* Creates two equal columns */\r\n        gap: 12px 24px !important; /* 12px row gap (reduced) and 24px column gap */\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    /* Styles each member block */\r\n    .member {\r\n        display: flex !important;\r\n        align-items: center !important;\r\n        gap: 16px !important; /* Space between photo and text */\r\n        list-style-type: none !important; \r\n        padding: 0 !important;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    /* Makes the team photos larger */\r\n    .member img {\r\n        width: 130px !important; /* Increased from 100px */\r\n        height: 130px !important; /* Increased from 100px */\r\n        object-fit: cover !important;\r\n        border-radius: 4px; \r\n        flex-shrink: 0 !important;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    /* Stacks name and title vertically next to the image */\r\n    .member-info {\r\n        display: flex;\r\n        flex-direction: column;\r\n        gap: 2px; /* Tightened text line spacing */\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    .member .name {\r\n        font-weight: bold;\r\n        font-size: 1.15rem;\r\n        color: #005A70; /* Portal theme color */\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    .member .title {\r\n        font-size: 0.95rem;\r\n        color: #555;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    /* Drops to 1 column on smaller mobile screens */\r\n    @media (max-width: 768px) {\r\n        .member-grid {\r\n            grid-template-columns: 1fr !important;\r\n            gap: 16px !important;\r\n        }\r\n    }\r\n</style><div id=\"page_description\"><section class=\"network-team\"><h2 class=\"group\">The Knowledge Portal Network Team</h2><p>The Knowledge Portal Team is a team of scientists and software engineers at the Broad Institute, the European Bioinformatics Institute, the University of California at San Diego, the University of Michigan, and many other collaborators from academia, industry, and non-profit organizations worldwide.</p><p class=\"institutions\"><a class=\"institution\" href=\"https://broadinstitute.org/\"><img src=\"https://hugeampkpncms.org/sites/default/files/users/user30/logo.png\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"846712f1-79fa-46e5-b92b-92edcd6d931f\" alt=\"Broad Institute logo\"></a> <a class=\"institution\" href=\"https://cmdga.org\"><img src=\"https://hugeampkpncms.org/sites/default/files/users/user30/UCSD-Logo.png\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"4a30786d-660b-4be0-806b-18890449d40b\" alt=\"UCSD logo\"></a> <a class=\"institution\" href=\"https://sph.umich.edu/\"><img src=\"https://hugeampkpncms.org/sites/default/files/users/user30/Michigan_Medicine_logo.svg_.png\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"bcf7038d-bbfa-4773-9e1b-be5fac201eb4\" alt=\"Michigan Medicine logo\"></a> <a class=\"institution\" href=\"https://www.ebi.ac.uk/\"><img src=\"https://hugeampkpncms.org/sites/default/files/users/user30/EMBL_EBI-logo_0.png\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"f844a237-7104-4800-b3f9-d0616b0fcfd7\" alt=\"EMBL-EBI logo\"></a></p></section><section class=\"team-section\"><h2 class=\"group\">Project Leadership</h2><ul class=\"member-grid\"><li class=\"member\"><p><img src=\"https://hugeampkpncms.org/sites/default/files/users/user30/Screenshot%202025-06-10%20120421.png\" alt=\"Noël Burtt\"></p><div class=\"member-info\"><a href=\"https://www.broadinstitute.org/bios/no%C3%ABl-burtt\"><span class=\"name\">Noël Burtt</span></a> <span class=\"title\">Principal Investigator</span></div></li><li class=\"member\"><p><img src=\"https://hugeampkpncms.org/sites/default/files/users/user30/flannick_jason_4.jpg\" alt=\"Jason Flannick\"></p><div class=\"member-info\"><a href=\"https://www.broadinstitute.org/bios/jason-flannick\"><span class=\"name\">Jason Flannick</span></a> <span class=\"title\">Principal Investigator</span></div></li></ul></section><section class=\"team-section\"><h2 class=\"group\">Current Team Members</h2><ul class=\"member-grid\"><li class=\"member\"><p><img src=\"https://hugeampkpncms.org/sites/default/files/users/user30/Brandes_MacKenzie.jpg\" alt=\"MacKenzie Brandes\"></p><div class=\"member-info\"><span class=\"name\">MacKenzie Brandes</span> <span class=\"title\">Project Manager</span></div></li><li class=\"member\"><p><img src=\"https://hugeampkpncms.org/sites/default/files/users/user30/Vlado%20Dancik.jpg\" alt=\"Vlado Dancik\"></p><div class=\"member-info\"><span class=\"name\">Vlado Dancik</span> <span class=\"title\">Computational Biologist</span></div></li><li class=\"member\"><p><img src=\"https://hugeampkpncms.org/sites/default/files/users/user30/MarcDuby.png\" alt=\"Marc Duby\"></p><div class=\"member-info\"><span class=\"name\">Marc Duby</span> <span class=\"title\">Principal Software Engineer</span></div></li><li class=\"member\"><p><img src=\"https://hugeampkpncms.org/sites/default/files/users/user30/Gage_Steve.png\" alt=\"Steven D. Gage\"></p><div class=\"member-info\"><span class=\"name\">Steven D. Gage</span> <span class=\"title\">Postdoctoral Researcher</span></div></li><li class=\"member\"><p><img src=\"https://hugeampkpncms.org/sites/default/files/users/user30/drew.png\" alt=\"Drew Hite\"></p><div class=\"member-info\"><span class=\"name\">Drew Hite</span> <span class=\"title\">Senior Software Engineer</span></div></li><li class=\"member\"><p><img src=\"https://hugeampkpncms.org/sites/default/files/users/user30/quy_broad_profile.jpg\" alt=\"Quy Hoang\"></p><div class=\"member-info\"><span class=\"name\">Quy Hoang</span> <span class=\"title\">Principal Software Engineer</span></div></li><li class=\"member\"><p><img src=\"https://hugeampkpncms.org/sites/default/files/users/user30/Dongkeun%20Jang%20-%20DK%20Jang%20(2).png\" alt=\"Dongkeun Jang\"></p><div class=\"member-info\"><span class=\"name\">Dongkeun Jang</span> <span class=\"title\">Principal User Experience/User Interface Architect</span></div></li><li class=\"member\"><p><img src=\"https://hugeampkpncms.org/sites/default/files/users/user30/Screenshot%202025-06-10%20121233.png\" alt=\"Julie Jurgens\"></p><div class=\"member-info\"><span class=\"name\">Julie Jurgens</span> <span class=\"title\">Scientific Communication and Curation Manager</span></div></li><li class=\"member\"><p><img src=\"https://hugeampkpncms.org/sites/default/files/users/user30/kyuryung.png\" alt=\"Kyuryung Kim\"></p><div class=\"member-info\"><span class=\"name\">Kyuryung Kim</span> <span class=\"title\">Postdoctoral Researcher</span></div></li><li class=\"member\"><p><img src=\"https://hugeampkpncms.org/sites/default/files/users/user30/ryan.png\" alt=\"Ryan Koesterer\"></p><div class=\"member-info\"><span class=\"name\">Ryan Koesterer</span> <span class=\"title\">Senior Computational Associate</span></div></li><li class=\"member\"><p><img src=\"https://hugeampkpncms.org/sites/default/files/users/user30/Alex.png\" alt=\"Alejandro Llamas Mejía\"></p><div class=\"member-info\"><span class=\"name\">Alejandro Llamas Mejía</span> <span class=\"title\">Postdoctoral Researcher</span></div></li><li class=\"member\"><p><img src=\"https://hugeampkpncms.org/sites/default/files/users/user30/Screenshot%202025-06-10%20120925.png\" alt=\"Annie Moriondo\"></p><div class=\"member-info\"><span class=\"name\">Annie Moriondo</span> <span class=\"title\">Software Engineer</span></div></li><li class=\"member\"><p><img src=\"https://hugeampkpncms.org/sites/default/files/users/user30/Nguyen_Lucas.jpg\" alt=\"Thanh (Lucas) Nguyen\"></p><div class=\"member-info\"><span class=\"name\">Thanh (Lucas) Nguyen</span> <span class=\"title\">Associate Computational Biologist</span></div></li><li class=\"member\"><p><img src=\"https://hugeampkpncms.org/sites/default/files/users/user30/Nguyen_Trang.png\" alt=\"Trang Nguyen\"></p><div class=\"member-info\"><span class=\"name\">Trang Nguyen</span> <span class=\"title\">Computational Associate I and PhD student</span></div></li><li class=\"member\"><p><img src=\"https://hugeampkpncms.org/sites/default/files/users/user30/Olorunfemi_Phebe.jpg\" alt=\"Phebe Olorunfemi\"></p><div class=\"member-info\"><span class=\"name\">Phebe Olorunfemi</span> <span class=\"title\">Project Manager</span></div></li><li class=\"member\"><p><img src=\"https://hugeampkpncms.org/sites/default/files/users/user30/alex_shilin.png\" alt=\"Alex Shilin\"></p><div class=\"member-info\"><span class=\"name\">Alex Shilin</span> <span class=\"title\">UI/UX Engineer</span></div></li><li class=\"member\"><p><img src=\"https://hugeampkpncms.org/sites/default/files/users/user30/patrick.png\" alt=\"Patrick Smadbeck\"></p><div class=\"member-info\"><span class=\"name\">Patrick Smadbeck</span> <span class=\"title\">Senior Software Engineer</span></div></li></ul></section><section class=\"team-section\"><h2 class=\"group\">Past Team Members</h2><ul class=\"member-grid\"><li class=\"member\"><p><img src=\"https://hugeampkpncms.org/sites/default/files/users/user30/Ruebenacker%20Oliver.jpg\" alt=\"Oliver Ruebenacker\"></p><div class=\"member-info\"><span class=\"name\">Oliver Ruebenacker</span> <span class=\"title\">Senior Software Engineer</span></div></li><li class=\"member\"><p><img src=\"https://hugeampkpncms.org/sites/default/files/users/user30/satoshi.png\" alt=\"Satoshi Yoshiji\"></p><div class=\"member-info\"><span class=\"name\">Satoshi Yoshiji</span> <span class=\"title\">Research Fellow</span></div></li><li class=\"member\"><p><img src=\"https://hugeampkpncms.org/sites/default/files/users/user30/Miad_Zandavi.jpg\" alt=\"Seid-Miad Zandavi\"></p><div class=\"member-info\"><span class=\"name\">Seid-Miad Zandavi</span> <span class=\"title\">Research Scientist</span></div></li></ul></section></div>",
